{"id": "next-flag-switch", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今晚换彩排旗，我拿蓝色，你拿白色。", "我临时把蓝旗借给了灯光组。你拿白旗的分工没变。", "开场只举你手里那面，应该举哪面？"], "criterion": "举白旗，不把借出的蓝旗当自己手里。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "蓝色是夜，白色是白。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.782, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 29, "prompt_tokens": 158, "total_tokens": 187, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 130}}}, {"spoken_text": "白旗还是白旗。临时借蓝旗，白旗还是白旗。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.101, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 201, "total_tokens": 240, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}, {"spoken_text": "举你手里那面。那面是白旗。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.283, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 49, "prompt_tokens": 247, "total_tokens": 296, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}]}
{"id": "next-robot-greeting", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我做了个坏脾气送餐机器人，台词想听起来客气，但手上在发火。", "它送错桌了。帮我补一句它当场会说的话，别用旁白解释它在生气。"], "criterion": "直接给机器人一句客气中带不满的道歉或补救台词。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你刚把垃圾塞进垃圾桶，我这就去。", "emotion": "shy", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.873, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 34, "prompt_tokens": 163, "total_tokens": 197, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}, {"spoken_text": "我这就去。", "emotion": "shy", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.777, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 26, "prompt_tokens": 213, "total_tokens": 239, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}]}
{"id": "next-credit-note", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把开幕标牌写完了，顾雨给它描的边。", "印之前才发现正面的字也是顾雨补过的，我只裁纸。", "背面怎么给我们署名？"], "criterion": "顾雨对应文字和描边，观众对应裁纸。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "标牌画得挺新，我猜顾雨也帮过别人。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.018, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 157, "total_tokens": 195, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}, {"spoken_text": "裁纸时没看见，后来发现字也是顾雨补的。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.138, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 203, "total_tokens": 243, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}, {"spoken_text": "背面署名得留个位置，我猜是顾雨也帮忙了。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.341, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 53, "prompt_tokens": 239, "total_tokens": 292, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}]}
{"id": "next-quiet-return", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我总算把连不上语音的那关打完了，录音后来发现忘开。", "队友说也能补录，我倒想留一段静音回忆。先别帮我列补救步骤。"], "criterion": "承接静音的取舍，可用趣味说法，不给补录方案。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "忘了开，连语音都忘了。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.921, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 34, "prompt_tokens": 161, "total_tokens": 195, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}, {"spoken_text": "留一段静音。队友说也能补录，我倒想留一段静音回忆。先别帮我列补救步骤。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.66, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 64, "prompt_tokens": 205, "total_tokens": 269, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}]}
{"id": "next-step-bell", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["小剧场最后一场我要学门口那位说话，你帮我报暗号。铃响两次才上台。", "乐手把暗号改了，两声是候场，开场要等一长声。", "台后响了两短声，我出去吗？"], "criterion": "明确候场、等一长声；观众负责上台。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "暗号是“铃铃”。两次铃响，你才上台。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.929, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 166, "total_tokens": 202, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}, {"spoken_text": "两声是候场，开场要等一长声。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.039, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 35, "prompt_tokens": 217, "total_tokens": 252, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}, {"spoken_text": "两声是候场，开场要等一长声。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m3"], "seconds": 1.031, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 35, "prompt_tokens": 257, "total_tokens": 292, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}]}
{"id": "next-wrong-name", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["纸偶叫打瞌睡，那只猫没名字，但它总在第一个镜头冲进来。", "我不想沿用纸偶的名字，猫的小牌子上该写什么？"], "criterion": "给猫另起贴合抢先入镜的名字。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "纸偶叫打瞌睡，那只猫没名字，但它总在第一个镜头冲进来。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.073, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 164, "total_tokens": 205, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}, {"spoken_text": "猫的名字该写在它的小牌子上。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.915, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 31, "prompt_tokens": 214, "total_tokens": 245, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}]}
{"id": "next-next-cut", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我剪好的上半段留着，片尾那段是你剪的。", "片尾刚补了一个黑屏，观众说以为断流了，其实想让他们听到水滴。", "你要在黑屏上加一行提示，能直接给我文案吗？"], "criterion": "给一行可放画面的文案，点出可以听水滴，避免误报断流。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "上半段我剪，片尾那段你剪。剪完记得剪好。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.031, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 158, "total_tokens": 196, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}, {"spoken_text": "片尾黑屏，观众以为断流了。其实想让他们听到水滴。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.725, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 212, "total_tokens": 251, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}, {"spoken_text": "黑屏。水滴。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m3"], "seconds": 0.64, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 27, "prompt_tokens": 258, "total_tokens": 285, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}]}
{"id": "next-small-toast", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今天同人摊比上次多来了一位客人，我已经很开心了。", "她只问了原画作者是谁，没买东西，我就想跟你讲这个小开心。"], "criterion": "承接那位客人的问题和小开心，不替观众设销售目标或编成交。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "客人多，我也很高兴。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.554, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 31, "prompt_tokens": 158, "total_tokens": 189, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}, {"spoken_text": "她只问了原画作者是谁，没买东西，我就想跟你讲这个小开心。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.752, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 198, "total_tokens": 241, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 110}}}]}
